","link":58},{"localized_name":"vae","name":"vae","type":"VAE","link":59},{"localized_name":"tile_size","name":"tile_size","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"tile_size"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"overlap","name":"overlap","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"overlap"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"temporal_size","name":"temporal_size","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"temporal_size"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"temporal_overlap","name":"temporal_overlap","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"temporal_overlap"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"IMAGE","name":"IMAGE","type":"IMAGE","links":[56]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"VAEDecodeTiled"},"widgets_values":[512,64,128,32],"widgets_values_named":{"tile_size":512,"overlap":64,"temporal_size":128,"temporal_overlap":32}},{"id":9829,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-20,600],"size":[900,230],"flags":{},"order":34,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{},"widgets_values":["# Cue the Boom: the scene shot\n\nLoad your **plate** (an object, the phone held still) and your **cue** (a noise: \"pf.\", \"KA-BOOM\", \"fwoooOOOM\", \"hissss\", or a clip with a snap in it).\n\n1. **CueSync Analyze Sound** finds the hit, the loudness per frame and when it stops.\n2. **CueSync Paint Scene** paints the control the way ainvfx-fluid was trained: your plate in six flat zones, the effect at its source, timed and sized by the cue.\n3. **LTX-2.5 + ainvfx-fluid** render it into the scene, image-to-video from your plate's frame.\n4. **CueSync Scene Shot** measures where the effect first shows and moves it onto your cue.\n\n---\nModified from the AInVFX/ainvfx-fluid sample workflow (LTX-2.x Community License); see workflows/README.md."]}],"links":[[1,9828,0,9816,0,"VIDEO"],[2,9824,0,9825,0,"AUDIO"],[3,9825,0,9826,0,"CUESYNC_CUE"],[4,9827,0,9826,1,"VIDEO"],[5,9827,0,9828,0,"VIDEO"],[6,"9815_9761",0,9828,1,"VIDEO"],[7,9826,3,9828,2,"CUESYNC_SCENE"],[8,9824,0,9828,3,"AUDIO"],[9,"9802_9720",0,"9802_9724",0,"MODEL"],[10,"9812_9741",0,"98